  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "One function, seven moves",
      "items": [
        "This is the whole enforcement story, and it lives in a single function of the runtime",
        "The order is fixed: the lease is checked before anything, and the judgement precedes every call",
        "The runtime never branches on a name, a label, or a product word \u2014 only on effects, leases and observations"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Two error classes, on purpose",
      "items": [
        "A component that raises, an unknown id, and a binding to nothing are all data \u2014 a Failed observation the agent can read and work around",
        "A port that raises is a failure \u2014 the host itself is broken, and the run ends rather than reasoning past it",
        "Refuse is not an error at all: it is a decision, recorded, with the component never called"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Ask is not a rejection",
      "items": [
        "Ask parks the run on a checkpoint and yields an Asked event to the host",
        "The answer may come back seconds later or from a different process entirely",
        "That is the same mechanism a slow human, a long job, or a sub-agent uses"
      ]
    }
  ]
